"desc.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for project files
"descother.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for non-project files
"run.bat" execute the Common18 application from the jar
"grab.btm" copy in Java source code from IntelliJ and build it. Roedy's use only.
"Common18.class" Common18 main Java program compiled byte code
"common18.manual.html" detailed HTML manual for the Common18 project
"common18.jar" jarred class files: Common utility classes that work under Java 1.8+ with enums and generics
"common18.look" uncommented jar manifest
"common18.jnlp" common18 jnlp Java Web Start launch
"common18-setup.exe" JET distributable, containing runtime
"common18.ico" Windows icon for the project, contains multiple image sizes
"common18.jpn" Manifest of what is included in the JET executable.
"common18.log" log of what JET did compiling and preparing the distributable
"common18.prj" JET project configuration, compiler options and notes on what needs to be included.
"common18.startup" List of classes JET should preload for speed.
"common18.xbind.script" List of DLLs JET will need to run the app.
"build_common18.bat" Build JET executable with project descriptor
"run_common18.bat" Runs the JET executable with default parm.
"mindprod.css" cascading style sheet for general HTML
"jdisplay.css" cascading style sheet for displaying source code in HTML
"package-info.java" Dummy Java source with JavaDoc describing the entire package.
"untouch.digest" generated: enables untouching (set date back) unchanged but redated files.
"mindprodcert2017rsa.cer" Public key for Mindprod code-signing certificate. Cannot be used to sign jars.
"DESCRIPT.ION" TCC file descriptions
"descript0.ion" generated file of overriding descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"descript2.ion" generated file default descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"MasterDistribution.site" URL to find the master copy of the Common18 project files
"common18.use" precis(summary) Common utility classes that work under Java 1.8+ with enums and generics Generated
"common18.vpj" Slick Edit project ini file
"common18.vpw" Slick Edit project ini file
"common18.vtg" Slick Edit binary tag xref file
"common18.icon16.png" 16x16 icon for the Common18 project
"common18.icon32.png" 32x32 icon for the Common18 project
"common18.icon48.png" roughly 48x48 icon for the Common18 project
"common18.icon64.png" roughly 64x64 icon for the Common18 project
"common18.icon128.png" roughly 128x128 icon for the Common18 project
"common18.screenshot.png" screenshot for the Common18 project
"common18.splash.gif" splash gif for the Common18 project
"common18.icon32.gif" 32x32 gif icon for the Common18 project
"common18.icon64.gif" 64x64 gif icon for the Common18 project
"_O_V_E_R_V_I_E_W.txt" Commented List of all files for Common18, with one line descriptions.
"use.txt" key facts about the Common18 project. Generates common18.use
"version.txt" key current version info about the Common18 project. Generates common18.use
"versionhistory.txt" complete version history of the Common18 project. Generates common18.use
"common18.txt" ASCII text manual for the Common18 project.
"build.xml" Complex ANT build script for Common18
"rebuild.xml" Simplified ANT build script for Common18
"forgather.xml" list of extra gather steps for ANT.
"forjar.xml" genjar list of extra files to include in common18.jar
"forjarexe.xml" jar.exe list of extra files to include in common18.jar
"forpost.xml" list of extra posting steps for ANT.
"forzip.xml" list of extra files for ANT include in common1831.zip
"common18.xml" ASP PAD desc of the Common18 project: Common utility classes that work under Java 1.8+ with enums and generics
"common1831.zip" Common18 3.1 distribute zip: Common utility classes that work under Java 1.8+ with enums and generics
"zip.look" uncommented zip manifest for common1831.zip
